                The Kubota BX23S is our overall pick for most property owners because a factory loader and backhoe on a lawn-friendly machine covers more real jobs than anything else in the class. The John Deere 1025R wins on dealer support and its one-minute AutoConnect mower deck. For genuine ground-engaging work on ten or more acres, step up to the heavier Kubota L2502.
